<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="no"?><!DOCTYPE task PUBLIC "-//SDL//DTD DITA Task//EN" "sdlTask.dtd"[]><?ish ishref="GUID-7F1BF24B-618B-407A-9BDA-F8C039CCA08C" version="2" lang="en-US"?><task id="GUID-7F1BF24B-618B-407A-9BDA-F8C039CCA08C" xml:lang="en-US"><title id="GUID-93646934-F5CD-4AFB-A0B6-93F9E74D6998">Clear Paper Jams</title><shortdesc>Paper jams occur when the paper from the paper tray misfeeds in the printer. </shortdesc><prolog><metadata><keywords><keyword ishcondition="MODEL=810AIO">810AIO</keyword><keyword ishcondition="MODEL=820AIO">820AIO</keyword><keyword ishcondition="MODEL=910AIO">910AIO</keyword><keyword ishcondition="MODEL=920AIO">920AIO</keyword><keyword ishcondition="Series='800_Series'"> 800 Series</keyword><keyword ishcondition="Series='900_Series'"> 900 Series</keyword><keyword>Acadian</keyword><indexterm>paper jams<indexterm>clearing</indexterm></indexterm></keywords></metadata></prolog><taskbody><prereq id="PREREQ_0D2144E341E744628344E7DE1B1D6520"><note id="GUID-EA5B06C6-772E-4591-96E8-45F79F69E554" conref="GUID-9244599E-6CDD-4C73-A045-1D2BFB0399A2#GUID-9244599E-6CDD-4C73-A045-1D2BFB0399A2/NOTE_TURN_OFF_PRINTER">Cancel print jobs and turn off the printer before attempting to remove jammed paper. </note></prereq><context id="CONTEXT_18006DC58C564F1086726FD55A91865C"><p>Common causes of paper jams are: <ul id="UL_8BE7C93541294E8F95362CD56B196898"><li id="LI_730D69B799D345E69693DA334A91323F">Paper is not loaded properly. </li><li id="LI_485ABF98482148A2BB51FB4F4627DE8F">And some changes are made to the topics. </li><li id="LI_8134520907C840369CC191853379D4D2">Paper is the wrong type for the printer. </li><li id="LI_286B3B485AF1466297C4A31D5F3DEC21">Too much paper is loaded in paper tray. </li></ul></p></context><steps id="STEPS_11048EDF2379424AACC9D38034DDDD9E"><step id="STEP_69D88895C6594A3F8D70D8E549C6F2D7"><cmd>Is <msgnum conref="GUID-09DF91A0-61EE-4E24-B3E9-EC6996F17470#GUID-09DF91A0-61EE-4E24-B3E9-EC6996F17470/ERROR_202">Error Code 202 </msgnum> displayed on the LCD? </cmd><choices id="CHOICES_AB7FFF772D6A4E02A85355C85561F142"><choice id="CHOICE_ADA1BB54D06B4E0AAFEB56507D6450CC">If Yes, then go to the <xref href="GUID-7F1BF24B-618B-407A-9BDA-F8C039CCA08C#GUID-7F1BF24B-618B-407A-9BDA-F8C039CCA08C/STEP_F541AD1878924CA4B836D7E7B3552CB4">next step</xref>. </choice><choice id="CHOICE_4C5AF056A2C2407E86D544296C90D6CC">If No, then go to <xref href="GUID-09DF91A0-61EE-4E24-B3E9-EC6996F17470" />. </choice></choices></step><step id="STEP_F541AD1878924CA4B836D7E7B3552CB4"><cmd> Is there paper sticking out of your printer? </cmd><choices id="CHOICES_ACF7DEB2C8784C9F81D870E9DBDF3998"><choice id="CHOICE_DF3682AE51294B39AF4F8A0833EEF19D">If Yes, then go to the <xref href="GUID-7F1BF24B-618B-407A-9BDA-F8C039CCA08C#GUID-7F1BF24B-618B-407A-9BDA-F8C039CCA08C/STEP_04BE4B097A7E4B43B6DC638766E48161">next step</xref>. </choice><choice id="CHOICE_4FD3A6BAFB22408CBF9208340ED732F2">If No, then go to <xref href="GUID-7F1BF24B-618B-407A-9BDA-F8C039CCA08C#GUID-7F1BF24B-618B-407A-9BDA-F8C039CCA08C/STEP_6543F10B943E49C08198BD992ED24C98">step 5</xref>. </choice></choices></step><step id="STEP_04BE4B097A7E4B43B6DC638766E48161"><cmd> Release the paper by opening the printer at panel A and lifting the lever. </cmd><info><xref href="GUID-7F1BF24B-618B-407A-9BDA-F8C039CCA08C#GUID-7F1BF24B-618B-407A-9BDA-F8C039CCA08C/STEP_4831696826A2472C8D61451D4B86454E">Continue</xref>. </info></step><step id="STEP_4831696826A2472C8D61451D4B86454E"><cmd>Carefully remove the paper from the back of the printer. </cmd><info><image href="GUID-2FE168C1-2D43-4178-95EF-425061E86CF1" id="IMAGE_92F023DE8D634A338C3A6C8EC44ABA34" placement="break" /></info></step><step id="STEP_6543F10B943E49C08198BD992ED24C98"><cmd> Insert new paper in the paper tray. </cmd><info><image placement="break" href="GUID-4DA0F690-D4E8-48BA-A857-33D19B764733" id="IMAGE_D39FC297B785416B8EC94C0DAE8E075D" /></info></step><step id="STEP_7DEC4CE41CBD4220BF8FD92BA3AB7856" ishcondition="Series='900_Series'"><cmd>Check the secondary paper tray. </cmd><info>The is the external paper tray below the main paper tray. </info></step><step id="STEP_34480C8F6F6E40818B9AD0AD7916977C"><cmd>Print a Diagnostic Page Report. </cmd><info><image placement="break" href="GUID-40AEA97D-E1C4-4D1A-9C7A-89A8DCD0398F" id="IMAGE_68807610EAF24CD88F6D9BBE3058DEA8" /></info><info>Did the diagnostic page print correctly? </info><choices id="CHOICES_8A998FC2A0984BB58B209F706C9C9FCB"><choice id="CHOICE_2AF9ED5DECF347B9BFA7E96B7BB0E9D5">If Yes, then you have successfully cleared the paper jam. </choice><choice id="CHOICE_0014F7413C934189A6CCD44698E75CD2">If No, then go to <xref href="GUID-34DEA6CD-2AFB-4E02-862B-BCA31196E12A">Unable to Print Diagnostic Page</xref>. </choice></choices></step></steps></taskbody></task>